    "sections": {
        "description": "Online Toys Shop Theme provides a structured storefront for displaying products, categories, offers, and essential shopping information. Toy Stores can organize products into clear categories and present product images, prices, descriptions, and other details through dedicated layouts. The responsive design adjusts content across desktop, tablet, and mobile screens, while readable typography and organized navigation support consistent browsing. Online Toy Shops can use product grids and category sections to arrange different collections within the storefront. Kids Toy Businesses can present featured products, promotional sections, and selected categories on the homepage. Educational Toy Stores can organize learning products into separate collections for easier browsing. Baby Product Stores can display product information through dedicated product pages with supporting images and descriptions. Children’s Gift Shops can use featured sections to highlight selected items or seasonal collections. The theme includes eCommerce functionality for product listings, shopping carts, and checkout pages. Customization options provide control over colors, typography, layouts, and other visual elements. Homepage sections can also be arranged according to the store’s content structure. Plugin compatibility can extend available features when additional functionality is required."
    },
